{"ticker":{"symbol":"028300.KQ","name":"HLB","market":"KR","exchange":""},"currency":"KRW","price":29400.0,"change_pct":-0.01672240802675584,"market_cap":3908480794624.0,"pe":null,"pb":null,"dividend_yield":null,"week52_low":0.0,"week52_high":69200.0,"sector":"Industrials","industry":"Building Products & Equipment","country":"South Korea","city":"Ulsan","employees":150,"website":"https://www.hlbbio.co.kr/","business_summary":"HLB Co., Ltd. manufactures and constructs lifeboats and glass fiber pipes in South Korea and internationally. It engages in the repair and inspection of lifeboats; fabrication and installation of pipes; development and manufacturing of biopharmaceuticals products, such as anti-cancer drugs; and manufacture and sale of medical devices, as well as manufacture and sale of quasi-drugs products, including alcohol swabs, sampling tools, etc. The company is also involved in e-commerce, investment, and financing activities. Additionally, it develops biological drugs with MoA to infectious diseases. HLB Co., Ltd. was founded in 1975 and is headquartered in Ulsan, South Korea.","business_summary_ko":"에이치엘비(주)는 국내는 물론 해외에서 구명정과 유리섬유파이프를 제조, 제작하는 회사입니다. 구명정의 수리 및 검사에 종사합니다. 파이프 제작 및 설치; 항암제 등 바이오의약품 개발 및 제조; 의료기기 제조 및 판매, 알코올 면봉, 검체 채취 도구 등을 포함한 의약외품 제조 및 판매 등을 영위하고 있으며, 전자상거래, 투자, 금융활동도 영위하고 있습니다. 또한 MoA를 활용하여 감염성 질환에 대한 생물학적 제제를 개발하고 있습니다. 에이치엘비(주)는 1975년에 설립되었으며 대한민국 울산에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","desc_ko":"","estimates":[{"period":"2026","rev":0.0,"rev_lo":0.0,"rev_hi":0.0,"rev_g":null},{"period":"2027","rev":0.0,"rev_lo":0.0,"rev_hi":0.0,"rev_g":null}],"ltg":null,"calendar":{},"industry_ko":"건축 제품 및 장비","financials":[{"period":"2022","revenue":179707913110.0,"operating_income":-74663395620.0,"net_income":-78158868860.0,"eps":-640.0},{"period":"2023","revenue":42900561190.0,"operating_income":-115955239260.0,"net_income":-187546646850.0,"eps":-1547.0},{"period":"2024","revenue":68125727340.0,"operating_income":-118366153420.0,"net_income":-91980166740.0,"eps":-704